  <data name="OurValues_Paragraph1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>At KickFive, football is more than just a game. It's about passion, teamwork, respect, and having fun. We believe every match is an opportunity to bring people together, challenge yourself, and create unforgettable moments.</value>
